{"id":881277,"title":"28｜课程智能客服：知识库检索方式","content":"在Dify平台创建并配置知识库的过程中，主要分为三个步骤：文档分段、索引方式配置和检索设置。文档分段是将上传的文档切分成多个文档块；索引方式配置涉及选择向量模型对文档块进行向量化处理，并存储到向量数据库中；检索设置则定义了用户提问后如何从数据库中找到相关文档片段并通过提示词模板组装成大模型可理解的问题。Dify支持三种检索模式：向量检索、全文检索及混合检索。向量检索通过将问题与文档片段向量化，并基于相似度匹配来筛选最相关的片段；为进一步提高精度，可以采用Rerank模型对初步筛选出的结果进行重排序。全文检索侧重关键词匹配，其与向量检索结合形成的混合检索模式，在利用两者优势的同时，也引入了Rerank机制以确保最终返回给大模型的信息既快速又准确。整个过程旨在优化信息检索效率与准确性，为用户提供更高质量的答案。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":400889,"user_name":"public","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2768731,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"EF597BADCC526B","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1749741153,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"PPT哪里下载","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":400757,"user_name":"Roway","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1060967,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"65AF589142AB6C","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/30/67/a1e9aaba.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1749350618,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":5,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"能私有化部署，是不是就可以本地化部署？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":2061756,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1f/75/bc/7b167a42.jpg","nickname":"zzzz","note":"","ucode":"F65179A18B8B9A","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":675840,"discussion_content":"是的","content_length":6,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1765961889,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"江苏","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":400703,"user_name":"jimmy","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3",